    "title": "Federal Reserve Is Grossly Behind the Curve: Investment Officer | NTD",
    "text": "The Federal Reserve kept interest rates unchanged on Wednesday as its policymakers assessed signs of a cooling economy, the risk of higher inflation from U.S. import tariffs, and the escalating crisis in the Middle East. For more analysis on the Fed's decision, NTD spoke to Louis Navellier, chief investment officer and chairman and founder of Navellier and Associates.\nFederal Reserve Is Grossly Behind the Curve: Investment Officer\nThe Federal Reserve kept interest rates unchanged on Wednesday as its policymakers assessed the economy, impact of tariffs, and crisis in the Middle East.\nBy\n|\nPublished: 6/18/2025, 11:18:14 PM EDT",
